WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.029
A website, a training program, or a whole business
platform: where should you start?

00:00:06.029 --> 00:00:08.182
Welcome to Elevate for Humanity.

00:00:08.182 --> 00:00:10.766
I am PARIS, your AI presenter.

00:00:10.766 --> 00:00:14.642
This episode is your guide to exploring the store.

00:00:14.642 --> 00:00:16.365
Begin with your role.

00:00:16.365 --> 00:00:22.394
Are you a small business owner, an instructor, an
employer, or a workforce organization?

00:00:22.394 --> 00:00:24.547
Next, name your immediate problem.

00:00:24.547 --> 00:00:27.131
Maybe customers cannot find your services.

00:00:27.131 --> 00:00:30.146
Maybe you need a clear course orientation.

00:00:30.146 --> 00:00:34.452
Maybe you need to organize employer inquiries or
training records.

00:00:34.452 --> 00:00:40.481
The store brings together business tools, AI assistants,
learning products, and workforce related modules.

00:00:40.481 --> 00:00:43.927
It also presents separately scoped standalone platform
builds.

00:00:43.927 --> 00:00:49.956
A monthly subscription and a standalone implementation
have different prices, responsibilities, and delivery
terms.

00:00:49.956 --> 00:00:54.262
Ask for a written scope before committing to custom
work.

00:00:54.262 --> 00:01:00.292
Confirm what is included, what needs setup, what is a
demonstration, and what ongoing

00:01:00.292 --> 00:01:01.153
costs remain.

00:01:01.153 --> 00:01:07.182
Free network promotion and employer job posting
opportunities are separate from paid software modules.

00:01:07.182 --> 00:01:13.211
Explore the barber and beauty network, employer
pathways, program holder application, and Supersonic
Fast

00:01:13.211 --> 00:01:15.795
Cash information through the main website.

00:01:15.795 --> 00:01:18.379
Availability, review, and service terms apply.

00:01:18.379 --> 00:01:24.408
Make a short list of three needs and request the
smallest setup that meets

00:01:24.408 --> 00:01:24.839
them.

00:01:24.839 --> 00:01:30.868
Follow Elevate free on Spotify, and send this overview
to someone building a business

00:01:30.868 --> 00:01:32.160
or serving learners.

